    "description": "Corrected source-verified evaluation of seismic temporal stacking on one fixed STEAD split, with recovered waveform identities, 106 checkpoints, fresh inference replay and conditional numerical audits. The PhaseNet-style baseline has a P advantage; primary S method differences remain unresolved. Historical development exposure prevents independent confirmation. No existing release DOI archives this corrected repository state.",
